0 RCX bumper car (Brickwright Robot Lab reference model)
0 Name: rcx-bumper-car.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // A MINDSTORMS RCX 2.0 on two 9 V mini-motors (A left, C right) with 56 mm wheels on
0 // their output axles, a ball castor at the front on two Technic bricks, a touch sensor
0 // bumper on the RCX's top front (input 1) and a light sensor looking down beside the
0 // castor (input 2), held by a pin/bush connector with two studs. Forward is LDraw +z.
0 // The front bricks sit half a stud off the RCX's grid: their studs grip the plate's tubes.
